        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    strike_price = 145\n    expiration_price = 140\n    premium_per_share = 3.25\n    contracts = 5\n    shares_per_contract = 100\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    total_shares = contracts * shares_per_contract\n    intrinsic_value_per_share = max(0, strike_price - expiration_price)\n    net_profit = (intrinsic_value_per_share - premium_per_share) * total_shares\n\n    # return answer\n    return round(net_profit)\n```",
